<title>SINGAPORE: Pac Can gets nod to list 3.55 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Pac Can gets nod to list 3.55 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pacific Can Investment Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday it had obtained in-principle approval from the Stock Exchange of Singapore to list 3.55 million new shares of Singapore $0.50 each in the company.</p>
<p>It gave no other details.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
